{"product_id":"macchina-da-stiro-automatica","title":"Macchina da Stiro Automatica","description":"\u003ch3 data-start=\"71\" data-end=\"102\" style=\"text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"71\" data-end=\"102\"\u003eDi’ Addio al Ferro da Stiro\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"104\" data-end=\"310\" style=\"text-align: center;\"\u003eBasta perdere tempo e fatica a stirare. Con la \u003cstrong data-start=\"151\" data-end=\"183\"\u003eMacchina da Stiro Automatica\u003c\/strong\u003e, indossi capi \u003cstrong data-start=\"198\" data-end=\"235\"\u003easciutti, lisci e pronti da usare\u003c\/strong\u003e in pochi minuti — senza asse da stiro, senza sforzo e senza complicazioni.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4 data-start=\"104\" data-end=\"310\" style=\"text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"312\" data-end=\"398\"\u003eInserisci il capo, accendi il dispositivo e lascia che l’aria calda lavori per te.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cdiv style=\"display: flex; justify-content: center; margin: 20px 0;\"\u003e\u003cvideo style=\"width: 70%; max-width: 700px; height: auto; display: block;\" playsinline=\"\" loop=\"loop\" muted=\"\" autoplay=\"autoplay\"\u003e\n    \n    \u003csource type=\"video\/mp4\" src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/videos\/c\/o\/v\/260ba4ce9c0f40e0b42527d650913847.mp4\"\u003e\u003c\/video\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003ch4 data-start=\"104\" data-end=\"310\" style=\"text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003ch3 data-start=\"400\" data-end=\"441\" style=\"text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"400\" data-end=\"441\"\u003eRisultato Professionale, Senza Sforzo\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"443\" data-end=\"630\" style=\"text-align: center;\"\u003eIl sistema a \u003cstrong data-start=\"456\" data-end=\"479\"\u003earia calda uniforme\u003c\/strong\u003e asciuga e distende allo stesso tempo, preservando i tessuti e garantendo una finitura impeccabile. Ideale per camicie, pantaloni, abiti e molto altro.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4 data-start=\"632\" data-end=\"664\" style=\"text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"632\" data-end=\"664\" data-is-last-node=\"\"\u003eTrasforma la tua routine ora\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h4\u003e","brand":"Spazio Lunare","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":56821999567173,"sku":null,"price":29.9,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/1017\/2265\/2997\/files\/4.2.webp?v=1768079447","url":"https:\/\/velora-home.site\/products\/macchina-da-stiro-automatica","provider":"Velora Home","version":"1.0","type":"link"}